    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"ConfigureDisplayControlsinPrint-PurposeandBenefits\">Purpose and Benefits</h2><p> Display controls can be printed as part or printing out registration cards from Registration App. This functionality is completely configurable based on user requirements.</p><h2 id=\"ConfigureDisplayControlsinPrint-Steps\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Steps</span></h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">The Print functionality for registration appears in the Registration module as shown below :</span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/72581122/Screen%20Shot%202015-11-18%20at%2012.09.47%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1467694086834&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=60\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/72581122/Screen%20Shot%202015-11-18%20at%2012.09.47%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1467694086834&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"72581125\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2015-11-18 at 12.09.47 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"72581122\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"5\" data-media-id=\"5acc213b-ad6a-49d0-9cd4-1d8e6877fe8d\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/72581122/Screen%20Shot%202015-11-18%20at%2012.09.47%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1467694086834&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1400&amp;height=120 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/72581122/Screen%20Shot%202015-11-18%20at%2012.09.47%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1467694086834&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=60 1x\"></span></span></p><h2 id=\"ConfigureDisplayControlsinPrint-PrintObservationdisplaycontrol\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Print Observation display control</span></h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Add following code in registration card print . Value of &quot;conceptNames&quot; in following code must be fully specified name.</span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"> </span></p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"ae7a21eb-822c-4394-8173-c68ad707ff82\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: xml; gutter: true; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\"> &lt;div class=&quot;print-wrapper&quot;&gt;\n \t&lt;link rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot; href=&quot;../styles/registrationPrint.css&quot; media=&quot;all&quot;/&gt;\n \t&lt;section class=&quot;block observation dashboard-section&quot;&gt;\n \t\t&lt;bahmni-observation patient=&quot;patient&quot; config=&quot;{conceptNames: ['Vitals']}&quot; section-title=&quot;'Vitals'&quot;&gt;\n\t\t&lt;/bahmni-observation&gt;\n \t&lt;/section&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;</pre>\n</div></div><p><span style=\"font-size: 20.0px;line-height: 1.5;\" class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 20.0px;line-height: 1.5;\" class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Print Diagnosis display control </span></p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"75a7e715-b302-4413-bbe7-91cabf13b6c8\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: xml; gutter: true; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\"> &lt;div class=&quot;print-wrapper&quot;&gt;\n \t&lt;link rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot; href=&quot;../styles/registrationPrint.css&quot; media=&quot;all&quot;/&gt;\n \t&lt;section class=&quot;block observation dashboard-section&quot;&gt;\n \t\t&lt;bahmni-diagnosis patient-uuid=&quot;::patient.uuid&quot;\n                  config='{&quot;title&quot;: &quot;Diagnosis&quot;,&quot;type&quot;: &quot;diagnosis&quot;}'&gt;&lt;/bahmni-diagnosis&gt;\n \t&lt;/section&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;</pre>\n</div></div><p><span style=\"font-size: 20.0px;line-height: 1.5;\" class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/72581122/Screen%20Shot%202016-07-05%20at%2012.37.14%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1467702470041&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=478\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/72581122/Screen%20Shot%202016-07-05%20at%2012.37.14%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1467702470041&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"72581133\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2016-07-05 at 12.37.14 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"72581122\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"5\" data-media-id=\"5ecc9cac-cbe5-4074-ac79-e72f610745e6\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/72581122/Screen%20Shot%202016-07-05%20at%2012.37.14%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1467702470041&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1200&amp;height=956 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/72581122/Screen%20Shot%202016-07-05%20at%2012.37.14%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1467702470041&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=478 1x\"></span><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 20.0px;line-height: 1.5;\" class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><br/></span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><br/></span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><br/></span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><br/></span></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro has-no-icon confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"e7b3588e-96e1-4de3-a29d-46427cf35a1e\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"96e956b8-ae81-4af2-8508-c5fa6e06f774\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p> </p></div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"f5e76242-9ad1-477e-9fa2-70ff0a12c473\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Feature Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32604190/Patient+Registration\" data-linked-resource-id=\"32604190\" data-linked-resource-version=\"38\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Registration - Feature Guide</a></span></p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
